.TH VIEWNIOR 1 "November 24, 2026"
.SH NAME
viewnior \- simple, fast and elegant image viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B viewnior
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
[\fIFILES\fR|\fIFOLDERS\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Viewnior is an image viewer program. Created to be simple,
fast and elegant. It's minimalistic interface provides more
screenspace for your images.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-slideshow\fR
Start in slideshow
.TP
\fB\-\-fullscreen\fR
Start in full screen mode
.TP
\fB\-?\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show this help and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version information and exit
.SH "KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS"
.SS Files
.TP
\fBCtrl+O\fR
Open an image
.TP
\fBCtrl+F\fR
Open a folder
.TP
\fBCtrl+S\fR
Save changes
.TP
\fBCtrl+C\fR
Copy the image to the clipboard
.TP
\fBDelete\fR
Delete the current file
.TP
\fBAlt+Return\fR
Show information about the current file
.TP
\fBCtrl+F8\fR
Set the image as the desktop wallpaper
.TP
\fBCtrl+W\fR
Close Viewnior
.SS Navigation
.TP
\fBSpace\fR, \fBPage Down\fR, \fBAlt+Right\fR
Go to the next image
.TP
\fBBackspace\fR, \fBPage Up\fR, \fBAlt+Left\fR
Go to the previous image
.TP
\fBRight\fR, \fBDown\fR / \fBLeft\fR, \fBUp\fR
Go to the next / previous image when the image fits in the window,
otherwise scroll it
.TP
\fBHome\fR, \fBAlt+Home\fR
Go to the first image
.TP
\fBEnd\fR, \fBAlt+End\fR
Go to the last image
.TP
\fBr\fR
Go to a random image
.SS Zoom
.TP
\fB+\fR, \fB=\fR, \fBCtrl++\fR, \fBCtrl+=\fR
Zoom in
.TP
\fB\-\fR, \fBCtrl+\-\fR
Zoom out
.TP
\fB1\fR, \fB2\fR, \fB3\fR, \fB5\fR
Zoom to 100%, 200%, 300% or 500%
.TP
\fBCtrl+0\fR
Show the image at its normal size
.TP
\fB0\fR, \fBf\fR
Fit the image to the window
.SS Image
.TP
\fBCtrl+R\fR
Rotate the image clockwise
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+R\fR
Rotate the image anti-clockwise
.TP
\fBh\fR
Flip the image horizontally
.TP
\fBv\fR
Flip the image vertically
.TP
\fBc\fR
Crop the image
.SS View
.TP
\fBF11\fR
Toggle full screen mode
.TP
\fBF5\fR
Toggle slideshow
.TP
\fBEscape\fR, \fBq\fR
Leave full screen or slideshow mode, otherwise close Viewnior
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.PP
Website: http://siyanpanayotov.com/project/viewnior/
